{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## Explicit no-LLM exclusion rerun\n\nRe-ran the frozen `2026-08-07T12:34:40Z` through `2026-08-23T21:15:00Z` cohorts with an additional hard inclusion rule: `metrics.llm_calls` must be numeric and greater than zero. All previous schema, active-sidecar, positive-duration, post-fix, and actual-`ran_model=bedrock` filters remain unchanged.\n\nResult: the primary statistics are unchanged because the provider-provenance filter had already implied an actual model run.\n- Plan: 1,514 eligible before the explicit call-count filter; zero removed. Every row has 21-33 `llm_calls`. p50/p90/p99 remain 189.332/325.337/443.163s; padded p50-to-p90 remains 227.199-390.404s (3.787-6.507m).\n- Completion: 683 eligible before the explicit call-count filter; zero removed. Every row has exactly one workflow `llm_calls`. p50/p90/p99 remain 87.253/155.830/748.663s; padded p50-to-p90 remains 104.703-186.996s (1.745-3.117m).\n- The matched visible-plan sample also remains unchanged: its matching rules require plan-review model-call records, and every paired sidecar has `llm_calls > 0`; p50/p90/p99 remain 330.248/488.088/621.329s, padded to 6.605-9.762m.\n\nBroader-pool audit explains why the filter matters even though it does not change the clean cohort. Among 1,982 post-fix plan-review schema rows, 160 have `llm_calls=0`; all are deterministic BLOCKs, with p50 1.353s and p90 6.544s. Another 32 lack call-count and duration metrics. Among 807 completion schema rows, 29 lack both call-count and duration metrics; the 778 measurable rows all have `llm_calls > 0`. These no/missing-LLM rows were absent from the primary provider-clean statistics already.\n\nFor sensitivity only, dropping actual-provider provenance but retaining the explicit `llm_calls > 0` rule yields plan n=1,790 at 188.249/324.288/444.417s and completion n=778 at 88.340/171.927/709.101s. Those extra rows have missing `ran_model`, so they are not preferred after the proven provider-misrouting issue."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787523862723478001,"uuid":"d54fcb61-ece7-4b16-b289-3ca08a76f92b"}